    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69478950e0674912ed07081f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69478950e0674912ed07081f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Dec 2025 05:59:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>年更主播回归，成功实现一年两更...（抱头逃窜）本期又是助教茶水间系列！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤖 当AI的发展愈发威胁高等教育的权威，除了抵制，是否存在一条和AI工具结合的历史学教学道路？这期我们请来了两位尝试用AI来编程历史本科教学游戏的助教们，来聊聊人工智能和历史学科教学的合作。在被AI抢走工作之前，让我们先用AI更好地工作吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Yizeng, Lexi</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 什么情况下想要用AI写课堂游戏？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a> 如何设计游戏的框架和机制？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a> 如何配合游戏进行教学指导？游戏如何成为课堂的一部分？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 用游戏来教学是不是对历史的娱乐化？如何看待游戏在教学理论上争议？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1869">31:09</a> 两位嘉宾的游戏如何处理游戏作为与历史人物“共情”的媒介？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2332">38:52</a> 技术上如何用AI做游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span>请大家期待下期！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期提要：</span></p><span></span><p><span>橙光游戏：枯棋录 &nbsp;<a data-url="https://www.66rpg.com/game/1265593" href="https://www.66rpg.com/game/1265593">www.66rpg.com</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>长野的故事：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm3BcoOykaDW0sKGfSbH-Vxmk_VX.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>简体中文版：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjzhQQb6GnmEwQjPbEMKBBkeN_X4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>苏丹的游戏：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtE7q8fISfgrnzWsZ9kWT1mO7Yxa.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
