  <item>
    <title>第2期｜水族馆也有历史？—— 和葛蔚蓝聊聊巴尔的摩的国家水族馆（National Aquarium）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6681733fcdd230b23b43b9a9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6681733fcdd230b23b43b9a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Jun 2024 15:01:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：University of Florida, PhD student, 葛蔚蓝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> 论文概要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> 巴尔的摩城市和国家水族馆的历史背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">09:02</a> 为什么选择国家水族馆作为研究对象？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a> 水族馆与海洋的关系、水族馆与人类的关系 —— 一种公共空间的构建</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1023">17:03</a> 水族馆和动物园有什么不同 —— 萨曼莎·穆卡（Samantha Muka）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">21:28</a> &nbsp;动物园和马戏团、水族馆和 Sea World ("海底世界"/“海洋乐园”)两对对子 —— 海洋和陆地、流动性的相对性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1638">27:18</a> &nbsp;“所以，水族馆究竟是什么？”一些相互启发的发散性思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1959">32:39</a> 水族馆带来的认知偏差；水族馆如何影响人们认识世界的方式？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2108">35:08</a> 前巴尔的摩市长 William Donald Schaefer 其人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> （并不是最后一个问题的问题）纪录片 Blackfish —— 虎鲸袭击饲养员事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2511">41:51</a> 回归主旨问题：城市与海洋的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2694">44:54</a> 海洋和城市的边界 —— 自然灾害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2769">46:09</a> 谁不想跟“可爱”又聪明的海洋动物贴贴呢？—— 等级化的生物认知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2947">49:07</a> 本频道经典“关了录音再唠十分钟的”：是什么话题让主播重新打开录音</span></p><span></span><p><span>一些补充材料：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtW-m2mI-Xut01EVM8fW9Lw-KF3C.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Francis Scott Key Bridge (Baltimore) Source: <a data-url="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Francis_Scott_Key_Bridge_" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Francis_Scott_Key_Bridge_">en.wikipedia.org</a>(Baltimore)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlKjFzyHpJnoknM8LgyF3zLzWd2x.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>“Then-Mayor William Donald Schaefer, doffing his hat and holding a rubber ducky, prepares to dive into the 70,000-gallon seal pool at the National Aquarium in the Inner Harbor in 1981. ” Source: </span><em><span>The Baltimore Sun, <a data-url="https://www.baltimoresun.com/2019/04/09/national-aquarium-to-unveil-mural-of-former-baltimore-mayors-seal-pool-swim/" href="https://www.baltimoresun.com/2019/04/09/national-aquarium-to-unveil-mural-of-former-baltimore-mayors-seal-pool-swim/">www.baltimoresun.com</a></span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqQwlEtRJnV5SfeJB12YvrCGBol2.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>Blackfish </span></em><span>Source: <a data-url="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blackfish_" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blackfish_">en.wikipedia.org</a>(film)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FschY86YTW-h05zYU8VThV17IeeI.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>"The Blue Crab is often a symbol of Maryland." Source: <a data-url="https://claudettecooks.wordpress.com/2018/01/22/blue-crab-photo-in-baltimore/" href="https://claudettecooks.wordpress.com/2018/01/22/blue-crab-photo-in-baltimore/">claudettecooks.wordpress.com</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpchv-bMgoRroLG-HTm1hDHfIS0L.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>美剧《火线》官方海报 图源豆瓣：<a data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1418199/" href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1418199/">movie.douban.com</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoxVaZYCvgFgFtGGbq0FxKaugcDb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>嘉宾为2025年AHA报告准备的ppt封面（已授权使用）</span></p>]]></description>
